<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar ends broadly flat.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar ends broadly flat.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed flat at 476.75/477.75 per dollar as the Central Bank sold dollars into a quiet market, trader said.</p>
<p>&quot;The Bank supplied whatever dollars were needed,&quot; said one broker who saw similar trade leading up to the Easter holidays next week.</p>
<p>The unit closed Tuesday at 476.50/477.75 per dollar. Wednesday was a market holiday.</p>
<p>((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
